{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 901, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0a6f0a7f8a8f0a98143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//사쿠라 군，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//さくらくん、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 764, "unit": "dialogue:b2732d0677eee785", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 974, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f2738143f273f274f0aff0ef81b82f2ff8b2f18ef0f4f157f7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f184f0c6f8b9f0c0f0a5f1c7f7d1", "baseline_text": "괜，괜찮아요∈//이 정도는…//오오가미 씨의 고생에 비하면…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だ、大丈夫ですよ！//このくらい……//大神さんの苦労にくらべたら……", "pointer_offset": 768, "unit": "dialogue:85e173bc052d7732", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1041, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f99cf184f0c6f0b2f0a8f0b8f7d12f2ff0d8f8f1f16bfa89f18ff0aef148f7d18148", "baseline_text": "내 고생이라니…//그게 무슨 소리야…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺の苦労……//なんだい、それ……？", "pointer_offset": 772, "unit": "dialogue:7862ef12d4496704", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1076, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f15781432f2ff271f0f9f0e7f7d12f2ff175f163f8e7f0c6f0f7f0a5f19af7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨는，//모두를…//평화를 생각하며…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんは、//みんなのことを……//平和のことを考えて……", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:445e735d14f9c41e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1133, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f2b6f0dff0b1f7d1f2b6f0dff0b181432f2ff0e2f0e4f0a2f0a3f14781432f2ff184f0c6f0a5f246f15af0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "언제나…언제나，//대장으로서，//고생하셨어요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いつも……いつも、//隊長として、//苦労していました……", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:e22948481c86d151", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1188, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f2618143f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff253f2c1f1448143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff0f4f9c6f2bdf2cbf26bf0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "그러니까，이번에는，//저희가，오오가미 씨를//도울 차례예요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから、今度は、//あたしたちが、大神さんを//助ける番なんです！", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:d5a1ef40c15dae60", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1251, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f0a6f0a7f8a8f0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "사쿠라 군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さくらくん……", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:f64e409aae788fab", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1266, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0d8fa62f28af7d1f184f0c6f8b2f0aff0b8f1488144", "baseline_text": "그런 건…고생이 아니야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そんなの……苦労じゃないさ。", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:f1b7e855282c6ce1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1295, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f14ef2d0f8f3f362f2a2f0f18144", "baseline_text": "그럼，조종은 맡길게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、操縦はまかせたよ。", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:a27b6abe3d9c34e1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1320, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0d8fa62f28af7d1f184f0c6f8b2f0aff0b8f14881442f2ff0b1f1acf0cf8143f0a6f0a7f8a8f8a9f1ccf1a7f8b2f2b82f2ff484f1daf1f3f8c8f1c8f0a8f984f0c6f0f7f14b8144", "baseline_text": "그런 건…고생이 아니야．//나보다，사쿠라 군 일행이 더//힘들었을 거라고 생각해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そんなの……苦労じゃないさ。//俺より、さくらくんたちの方が//大変だったと思うよ。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:a05924b26a9d3641", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1401, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff184f0adf1c9f0eff7d12f2ff0dbf9c2fb95f1e2f346f1478144", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…//고마워요…//신경 써 주셔서．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん……//ありがとうございます……//気づかってくれて。", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:93cd7e23e6c99173", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1460, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0dff162f163f164f965f1bef0c7f1cef0f481432f2ff174f0aef163f164f965f1bef0c7f1cef0f4f7d1", "baseline_text": "제국화격단 여러분도，//파리화격단 여러분도…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "帝国華撃団のみんなも、//巴里華撃団のみんなも……", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:10f3b6539cf89fd2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1509, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f271f8f9f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0b9f0f12f2ff0e9f0a6f0a5f984f154f8c8f1c8f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "모두 오오가미 씨에게//감사하고 있을 거예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんな、大神さんには//感謝の気持ちで//いっぱいだと思いますよ。", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:9a3eb49bf14077c9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1572, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0b1f8f4f271f0f9f8e1f14ff0e2f0b92f2ff0a4f8a4f287f0f4f38481432f2ff158f36df14bf148f29ef15a8144", "baseline_text": "나도 모두의 기대에//지지 않도록，//노력해야겠어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "俺も、みんなの期待に//負けないように、//がんばらないといけないな。", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:895e15a97ad7463a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1639, "capacity": 76, "raw_hex": "f0f081b8f253f0f481432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0b9f8f1f484f8b2fa98f94af154f0f4f38481432f2ff0adf2c3f8c3f14ff1cdf8c8f2b8fecaf181f0adf0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "네∈저도，//오오가미 씨에게 힘이 될 수 있도록，//마음과 기술을 더욱 연마하겠습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい！　あたしも、//大神さんの力になれるように、//もっと心と技をみがきます！", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:67c71a315474fc45", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1716, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f1cff0aff7d12f2ff0b1f144f148f0aaf8e7f2e4f0c7f557f0aef0fa81b82f2ff0a6f0a7f8a8f0a98143f484f8c8f48ef9b2f26581b8", "baseline_text": "좋아…//나가야스를 쓰러뜨리자∈//사쿠라 군，힘을 빌려 줘∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし……//長安を倒すぞ！//さくらくん、力をかしてくれ∈", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:b6c12bbb53deca4b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2663, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b82f2ff0dbf168f8a4f0a6f0a7f0a8f7d12f2ff28bf272f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다∈//신구지 사쿠라…//따르겠습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解！//真宮寺さくら……//お供いたします∈", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:1b99fb822ee5fb72", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1814, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0adfba3f249f2f5f0a5f955f360f0b2f1f3f15a81442f2ff0d8f2ca8143f5c2f16bf8e1f14ef2d0f0f32f2ff293f35cf257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "마침 피곤하던 참이었어．//그럼，쌍무의 조종은//부탁할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょうど、疲れてたんだ。//じゃ、双武の操縦は//まかせたよ。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:d6917bfc31e0e371", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2708, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b9f4bd81ac2f2ff1478143f5c2f16bf957fa53f254f0faf147f1572f2ff25ef374f9ccf94af1b5f0cff184f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "에엑〓//서，쌍무는 저 혼자서는//움직일 수 없다고요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え〓//そ、双武はあたし一人じゃ//動かせませんよ！", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:e495a9d5c96e42ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1922, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f15a8148f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff0b1f8e7f459f8f1f94bf1e2f29ef0cff1572f2ff263f0b2f7d1", "baseline_text": "어？하지만…//나를 쉬게 해 주겠다는//말이…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え？　でも……//俺を休ませてくれるって//話じゃ……", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:75995b8b7ab3dcaf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 1973, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff0b2f299f1d4f8f3f991f267f0ef81442f2ff2c9f8aff1e2f1d5f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…//이것만은 안 돼요．//알아 주세요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん……//これだけは、ダメなんです。//わかってください……", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:ab9fdf70cb17b88b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2036, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf157f7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f9d7f2538143f1bcf0b2f1472f2ff25ef374f0b2f957f1c8f0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "쌍무는…//오오가미 씨와 저，둘이서//움직이는 거니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武は……//大神さんとあたしの二人で//動かすものなんですから……", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:ac72b8e807262751", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2101, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f253f14ff7d1f293f35cf0f381432f2ff0cffb68f2e1f8a3f94bf1e2f24df143f0ef81482f2ff0dff944fa57f94af154f957f47dfa79f19cf0b9f147f7d1", "baseline_text": "저기…부탁은，//다른 걸로 해 주실래요？//제가 할 수 있는 범위 내에서…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あの……お願いごとは、//ほかのことにしてもらえますか？//あたしにできる範囲で……", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:724811ef39df342c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2182, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0d88143f0d8f2f0f1f3f0a4f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0cffb68f293f35cf8c8f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "그，그랬었지…//그럼，다른 부탁을 할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そ、そうだったね……//じゃ、ほかの頼みにするよ。", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:a475dfe731eafad1", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2231, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f2c3f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0e2f8e4f2b4f257f8c8f1abf5f62f2ff2e6f0a8f957fa8af991f298f26181ac", "baseline_text": "음…//그럼，대장 역할을 바꿔//달라는 건 안 될까〓", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うーん……//じゃ、隊長をかわって//もらうってのはダメかな〓", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:a8e306e76f0e148c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2290, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f991f577f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "안 됩니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ダメです。", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:1d15dd6bba2f14db", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2301, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0a58143f0a5f0aff7d12f2ff0b2fa8af293f35cfa57f1ccf8c8f3d6f14ff1442f2ffaccf15af57df29ef0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "하，하아…//이건 부탁할 일을 찾기가//꽤 어렵겠네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "は、はあ……//これは、願い事を探すのが//大変そうだな……", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:e3eba29ee54dd04d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2358, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781432f2ff0c6f8f7f140f0b2f0dbf144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "…오오가미 씨，//생각 중이신가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……大神さん、//考えごとですか？", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:98c6fd625143418b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2391, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f39df374f0b62f2ff15af256f8f1f0e2f195f14bf948f257f0a42f2ff184fbe1f140f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "아니，솔직히//어떻게 대답해야 할지//고민 중이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、正直//どう答えようかと//迷っているんだ。", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:98b1c27b28d822ae", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2438, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0abf191f14bf7d12f2ff0d8f27ef8f1f184f461f8f1f0c6f0f7f0a5f984f154f8c8f285f0f32f2ff3a7f3aff15a8144", "baseline_text": "미안해…//그렇게 고맙게 생각하고 있을 줄은//몰랐어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すまない……//そんなに感謝してくれているとは//思ってなかったんだ。", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:7c577f3a0ff1a62c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2505, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f1adf2cef2cef7d12f2ffa63f28bf279f957f473f8eff1b5f15af0ef81442f2ff8d8f0adf2c3f8b2f14ff3b4f2e1f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "우후후…//말 따위는 필요 없어요．//그 마음이 기쁜걸요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うふふ……//言葉なんかいりません。//その気持ちがうれしいんです。", "pointer_offset": 884, "unit": "dialogue:428183b9d398045f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2570, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0a6f0a7f8a8f0a9f7d12f2ff184f0adf1c98144", "baseline_text": "사쿠라 군…//고마워．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さくらくん……//ありがとう。", "pointer_offset": 888, "unit": "dialogue:53e8c09cb6175578", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04006.SBN", "offset": 2599, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0f081b8f253f2c1f0f4f7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e7f279f14bf14781432f2ff36bf36cf8b6f257f0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "네∈저희도…//오오가미 씨를 위해서，//열심히 할게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい！　あたしたち……//大神さんのために、//がんばります！", "pointer_offset": 892, "unit": "dialogue:f04d4b98b99d3cc3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
